-## Open Design Choice: Concurrent Visit Edits
+| Field | Meaning |
+|---|---|
+| `visit_id` | Client-generated UUID identifying the visit across its revisions. |
+| `idempotency_key` | Stable key for one submission, reused for retries. |
+| `base_revision_id` | Revision the worker started from; null for an initial submission. |
